Your Feedback decay now heals you for [0.7, 1.3, 1.7, 2.1, 2.5 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] times the loss, and the decay rate is reduced to [89%, 76%, 67%, 61%, 56% (TL1-5)] of the normal rate (up to [9.0%, 7.6%, 6.8%, 6.1%, 5.6% (TL1-5)] per turn).  As a result, you are healed for [6.72%, 9.60%, 12%, 13%, 14% (TL1-5; WIL 100)] of your feedback pool each turn.

The healing effect improves with your Willpower.
